==English==

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|fr|impressionnisme}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|arts}} An [[art movement]] characterized by [[visible]] [[brushstroke]]s, [[ordinary]] [[subject matter]], and an [[emphasis]] on [[light]] and its changing [[quality|qualities]].
# {{lb|en|music genre}} A [[style]] that avoided [[traditional]] [[harmony]], and sought to invoke the [[impression]]s of the [[composer]].
# {{lb|en|poetry}} A style that used [[imagery]] and [[symbolism]] to portray the [[poet]]'s impressions.

